=head1 DESCRIPTION

The policy for allowed types of authentication in a user pool. To
activate this setting, your user pool must be in the Essentials tier
(https://docs.aws.amazon.com/cognito/latest/developerguide/feature-plans-features-essentials.html)
or higher.

=head1 ATTRIBUTES


=head2 AllowedFirstAuthFactors => ArrayRef[Str|Undef]

The sign-in methods that a user pool supports as the first factor. You
can permit users to start authentication with a standard username and
password, or with other one-time password and hardware factors.



